{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K7lQ2MmmPH06jKtbv-ZaEg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:08.513496+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K7lQ2MmmPH06jKtbv-ZaEg","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/8OgSFnVWQPFXoDYu6KOrEum5iaUibrFkZrKk1fiaDVBYicBMbqg1WbMSh2g6uGjAp1WCs4pA5ficS0NMYUAZcjk6YrAy1Jxq0SyZW5ZnpVcA5rSY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>各相关考生：</span></p><p><span>为方便考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，我院将开通2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生和博士学位研究生（以下简称推免生）预报名系统，欢迎广大考生积极报名。报名前请提前查看《山东大学2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生和本科直博生预报名通知》。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学术学位：</span></p><p><span>140100集成电路科学与工程</span></p><p><span>专业学位：</span></p><p><span>085403 集成电路工程</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．预计可获得或已经获得所在本科毕业学校推荐免试资格的考生均可报名，暂未确定是否可以获得推荐免试资格的考生可先行报考。</span></p><p><span>2．报名开始时间： 2026年9月1日上午09:00，截止时间： 2026年9月10日17:00。</span></p><p><span>3．登录山东大学研究生招生平台（https://yanzhao.sdu.edu.cn），选择“推免预报名”，首次登录系统请注册，已报考夏令营的考生无需再次注册。</span></p><p><span>4．登录系统后，系统列出可报考的项目列表，每个项目为一个招生单位。每名考生最多可选择三个招生单位，每个招生单位内仅可选择一个专业报考。</span></p><p><span>5．报名信息提交后，在报名时间段内如需修改信息，可点击志愿列表中“修改”按钮进行修改，修改后请再次提交。</span></p><p><span>6．请认真核对报名信息，确保为提交状态，未提交的报名信息无效。</span></p><p><span>7．报名后请关注系统审核结论，如信息被退回修改，请在规定时间内按要求修改后重新提交。</span></p><p><span>8．我院将于9月中下旬起择优通知考生参加复试。具体复试时间、形式和复试录取办法将在学院网站公布。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8OgSFnVWQPGLv0gtZmIfFRqJbdKO3pMGz4vN6gAePzD8ngHiaial8PCPmjfBhVJ0NNrdbahK2ic66kG4MFGU5sG93mjJqaf8aa4F4ClibP4SYlQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 申请攻读研究生报告，内容包括个人信息简介，学习、科研简要经历，对申请专业的认识及未来学习科研规划等；</span></p><p><span>2．思想政治素质和品德考核表（点击下载）；</span></p><p><span>3．本科阶段成绩单，须加盖学校教务主管部门公章；</span></p><p><span>4．外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></p><p><span>5．获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>6．体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料；</span></p><p><span>7．在校期间参军入伍服兵役、参加志愿服务、到国际组织实习等证明材料；</span></p><p><span>8．回避情况说明。凡有直系亲属或利益相关人员在我校工作，尤其是在所申请推免的招生单位工作的，要主动说明报备。对未按规定报备声明回避关系且影响推免过程和结果公平公正的学生，学校将取消其推免资格。</span></p><p><span>9．本人签名的诚信承诺书（点击下载）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1．因教育部推免相关文件暂未下达，报名系统中所列的专业信息及相关推免政策可能会有所调整。</span></p><p><span>2．学院采取线下考核的形式，考核形式为面试。将于9月中旬起择优通知考生参加考核，考核复试总成绩低于60分者（成绩为百分制），不予录取。</span></p><p><span>3.后续相关复试相关通知将会在山东大学集成电路学院官网-研究生教育-研究生招生-通知公告中公布，请及时关注系统及学院网站通知。</span></p><p><span>4．报名期间如有问题，请及时与我们联系。</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0531-88390132，邮箱：jcdlyjw@sdu.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span>点击此处进入报名系统</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>图</span></span><span><span>文 | 云清</span></span></p><p><span><span>编辑 | 马珊</span></span></p><p><span><span>一审一校 | 陈宜然</span></span></p><p><span><span>二审二校 | 张欣欣 王锦涛</span></span></p><p><span><span>三审三校 | 葛凯 李阳</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8OgSFnVWQPHsjDYl5H2DQPfXQnepvV7FttDFzicR5xUdQNqdAZic9Ob8th8bNfPuqLWuetGicSHJNZzv9u7ribcfmxXEFIPhNnKfzzSsTHOSXTk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院官网</span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/8OgSFnVWQPHWd2Yrv7nhFnAiaia0HZEnJpXsMF3T56nIpnibevHM1n8HZy5iasWE1FC8MSTjibm1NUFl3vCialTfqJOSLEPQ7sQnJy2z6sYVER818/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院公众号</span></span></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/8OgSFnVWQPFlH5bVyEqFYvOOVUrOEytDvA9vBb9e9RzNDdF84FPKbSz8TyAYxl6F73gKA77YGKDicfpP3OtzxOiaZ7mk0jDibQvDo3Me3F1LQg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>芯片工程师简章</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/8OgSFnVWQPEJjXcibibCB9WxGYKRgiaicMLLn8icKpaVE7NPqurv21PwvGw6rP3x3c32CyGez6ct544ceKxAs6hjnbtvCqFqkSE2w8N1u9YWr77I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>未来诺奖基金</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1f5462372233ae77c13d5f469a7b267e5d8d5a131d446db0ab2918e047dcb04e","textLength":1231,"sourceSha256":"587a4de79988a0de1a83487446c3703dfed148cc8305eba8431839ecea430bf0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2ed67fc4ac008e9bec67","title":"2026年山东大学集成电路学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:08.513496+00:00"}
